PLACEHOLDER — AstraOS boot logo (pixmaps)

This file is a placeholder. At ISO build time, the customize_airootfs.sh script
(or the Makefile) must copy the real AstraOS boot logo to this exact path:

    /usr/share/pixmaps/astraos-boot.png

Source asset: /home/z/my-project/astraos/assets/logos/logo-boot.png
  (the magenta star AstraOS logo — used for boot/splash screens)

Suggested copy directive to add in customize_airootfs.sh:

    install -Dm0644 \
        /home/z/my-project/astraos/assets/logos/logo-boot.png \
        "${AIROOTFS}/usr/share/pixmaps/astraos-boot.png"

This file is intentionally a text placeholder so the build does not fail if
the binary asset is missing in this repo snapshot.
